   - **IntersectionObserver**: Replaced scroll-progress trigger for count-up animation — fires when `[data-story-stats]` is 35% visible, 1-fire-only via `disconnect()` + `storyStatsFired` guard
   - **`PageTheatreBinder._syncScene` async staleness**: Root cause hypothesis for why `story.onProgress` wasn't firing — async `requestId` check `if (!port || requestId !== this._sceneRequestId) return` could silently drop callbacks
   - **`onScrollTimelineInit` hook**: Safe DOM-ready init point in `mainConfig` for registering observers/side-effects
   - **Simple Icons CDN**: `https://cdn.simpleicons.org/{slug}/ffffff` for tool chip icons
   - **rAF count-up**: `ease-out cubic (1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3))`, 1800ms duration, 150ms stagger per stat item
   - **BEM SCSS**: `fluid()` helper, `var(--gutter-*)` tokens, `inline-flex` chip layout
   - **ScrollSceneRuntime**: `applyProgress` callback only fires for the currently active scene key; activation determined by viewport center proximity

3. Files and Code Sections:
   - **`resource/scss/pages/_main.scss`**
     - Added `display: inline-flex`, `align-items: center`, `gap: fluid(4, 6)` to `&__item-tool` + nested `img` rule:
     ```scss
     &__item-tool {
       display: inline-flex;
       align-items: center;
       gap: fluid(4, 6);
       padding: fluid(4, 6) fluid(8, 12);
       border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
